OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors to vote on purchase of
OL,4,Atown centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA final decision on a proposed #13m
OL,7,Fpurchase of a town centre will be put
OL,8,Fbefore councillors next week.
OL,10,FMembers of Stockton's Labour-run
OL,11,Fcabinet will decide on 4 November
OL,12,Fwhether or not to acquire the town
OL,13,Fcentre from current owners Sheet Anchor
OL,14,FEvolve.
OL,16,FThe initial purchase and other works
OL,17,Fwould be funded by a #20m grant which
OL,18,Fwas approved by the previous
OL,19,FConservative government in 2023 and
OL,20,Flater confirmed by the current Labour
OL,21,Fadministration.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
