OL,3,GNEWSACouncillors to vote on purchase of
OL,4,Atown centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FPapers outline that, since 2008, the
OL,7,Fcentre has had four private sector
OL,8,Fowners, "none of whom have invested in
OL,9,Fthe asset", with the current owner
OL,10,Findicating that it isn't planning
OL,11,F"major repair and improvement works".
